{
  "longTitle": "A Bill to make provision that persons receiving a training wage are exempt from legislation relating to the minimum wage; and for connected purposes.",
  "summary": "The Bill would provide that anyone entitled to the national minimum wage, as defined in the National Minimum Wage Act 1998, would lose that entitlement if they had entered into a written contract of employment offering them a training wage and training from the employer in skills relevant to the employment.",
